WEBVTT

00:11:27.699 --> 00:11:30.136
"A three year-old
is not half a six year-old."

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.976
(Laughter)

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:37.529
(Applause)

00:11:37.553 --> 00:11:38.665
They're three.

00:11:38.689 --> 00:11:40.689
But as we just heard in this last session,

00:11:40.713 --> 00:11:43.976
there's such competition now
to get into kindergarten --

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.859
to get to the right kindergarten --

00:11:45.883 --> 00:11:49.715
that people are being interviewed
for it at three.

00:11:51.839 --> 00:11:53.913
Kids sitting in front
of unimpressed panels,

00:11:53.937 --> 00:11:55.414
you know, with their resumes --

00:11:55.438 --> 00:11:58.029
(Laughter)

00:11:58.053 --> 00:12:00.327
Flicking through and saying,
"What, this is it?"